    "statement": "All PHQ, GAD-7 screeners and translations are downloadable from this website and no permission is required to reproduce, translate, display or distribute them. (Instruction manual: \"All of the measures included in Table 1 are in the public domain. No permission is required to reproduce, translate, display or distribute.\")",
