    "note": "English form as published on phqscreeners.com, read 2026-10-17; the check-mark instruction is left out."
  },
  "scoring": {
    "text": "Sum of items 1–7 (0–21), in gad7_total. Cutpoints from the instruction manual: 5, 10 and 15 = mild, moderate and severe anxiety."
  },
